WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 7

01:39.540 --> 01:40.880
There's one more thing.

01:43.090 --> 01:45.280
You must release Teng Zijing.

01:47.330 --> 01:49.000
He had a record

01:49.370 --> 01:50.880
in the Ministry of Penalty

01:50.900 --> 01:52.770
and he came back to the capital with you.

01:53.620 --> 01:55.800
I'm afraid he's up to something.

01:55.820 --> 01:57.240
He's my friend.

01:59.260 --> 02:01.810
It's too extravagant

02:02.050 --> 02:03.920
to have a friend in the capital city.

02:06.580 --> 02:09.450
Sure, I'll have him released.

02:09.650 --> 02:12.040
Be careful yourself.

02:12.060 --> 02:12.700
Why didn't you apologize

02:12.700 --> 02:14.480
to Fan Sizhe just now?

02:18.290 --> 02:19.780
How can a father

02:19.780 --> 02:22.200
apologize to the son?!

02:25.620 --> 02:27.450
Just stick to that sense of pride.

02:32.420 --> 02:33.730
Thank you!

02:34.780 --> 02:36.040
Thank me?

02:36.090 --> 02:38.000
I owe you one.

02:38.180 --> 02:39.240
From today onwards,

02:39.260 --> 02:40.880
I won't work against you

02:40.900 --> 02:42.760
as long as you don't make it difficult to me.

02:44.730 --> 02:46.840
Are you making peace with me?

02:57.820 --> 02:58.490
Your guards

02:58.490 --> 03:00.160
can't catch me at all.

03:00.180 --> 03:01.010
I didn't resist

03:01.010 --> 03:02.240
for your sake.

03:02.260 --> 03:04.170
I should thank you in that sense.

03:05.180 --> 03:06.120
Did you get the file?

03:06.140 --> 03:07.270
Not yet!

03:07.290 --> 03:08.320
Why?

03:08.340 --> 03:09.630
It's said that it's hard to find as there are too many.

03:09.650 --> 03:11.330
Wang Qinian will send it to me tomorrow.

03:11.930 --> 03:13.330
That's good!

03:13.540 --> 03:15.960
I owe you on this.

03:15.980 --> 03:17.890
Why does everyone owe me?

03:19.210 --> 03:20.320
How about this?

03:20.340 --> 03:21.690
I kill someone for you.

03:23.340 --> 03:24.470
Who... do you want to kill?

03:24.490 --> 03:25.290
It's up to you.

03:25.290 --> 03:26.650
I just come to the capital city

03:26.650 --> 03:28.640
and hardly know any people.

03:28.780 --> 03:29.290
Shall I kill

03:29.290 --> 03:30.400
Liu Ruyu for you?

03:30.420 --> 03:31.630
Let's calm down!

03:31.650 --> 03:32.450
I understand that

03:32.450 --> 03:33.470
you want to express your gratitude to me.

03:33.490 --> 03:35.140
But can you choose another way?

03:35.140 --> 03:35.700
She is very suspicious

03:35.700 --> 03:36.420
for the Danzhou assassination.

03:36.420 --> 03:37.700
Suspicion is all it is about.

03:37.700 --> 03:39.730
Besides, the Crown Prince is also suspicious.

03:41.010 --> 03:42.270
You want to kill the Crown Prince?

03:42.290 --> 03:43.370
It's a bit difficult.

03:43.370 --> 03:44.180
We've gotta get it planned well.

03:44.180 --> 03:45.960
Can we just have a normal conversation?

03:45.980 --> 03:47.190
I have no other feat left.

03:47.210 --> 03:48.810
I don't need your feat

03:51.370 --> 03:53.170
and certainly not your meat either.

03:55.850 --> 03:56.910
It's just a joke.

03:56.930 --> 03:58.090
Have you heard of the saying that

03:58.090 --> 03:58.650
the dancer goes feat not meat?

03:58.650 --> 03:59.810
No!

04:01.780 --> 04:03.000
Forget about it!

04:07.930 --> 04:09.060
There is a guy named Xu Yunzhang
at the Investigator's Office.

04:09.060 --> 04:10.480
Do you know him?

04:10.850 --> 04:11.420
Just like me,

04:11.420 --> 04:13.090
he is also from the Fourth Division of the Investigator's Office.

04:15.340 --> 04:16.800
It was him who made up the secret order

04:16.820 --> 04:17.840
for the Danzhou assassination.

04:17.860 --> 04:18.820
Does that mean

04:18.820 --> 04:19.460
we can find out who is behind the scene

04:19.460 --> 04:20.630
once we find him?

04:20.650 --> 04:22.040
He is already dead.

04:22.490 --> 04:23.140
Do you know who he usually contacted

04:23.140 --> 04:24.590
when he was alive?

04:24.610 --> 04:25.970
I'm not familiar with him.

04:26.170 --> 04:28.760
Making friends is really not something I'm good at.

04:30.210 --> 04:31.640
Easy to tell.

04:32.140 --> 04:33.590
Can I just kill a person for you?

04:33.610 --> 04:34.470
Keep it on the account!

04:34.490 --> 04:35.420
I shall turn to you immediately

04:35.420 --> 04:37.130
if I want to have someone killed in future.

04:42.890 --> 04:44.320
What's up?

04:45.210 --> 04:46.280
I was wondering

04:46.300 --> 04:47.740
there might be a place

04:47.740 --> 04:48.770
where we can get some clues

04:48.770 --> 04:50.440
about Xu Yunzhang before his death.

04:51.260 --> 04:52.520
Then let's go now!

04:52.540 --> 04:53.680
I'm a dead person now.

04:53.700 --> 04:54.590
It's improper to show up in public.

04:54.610 --> 04:56.090
I can do it myself.

04:59.210 --> 05:00.120
What's your height?

05:00.140 --> 05:01.400
What?!

05:01.420 --> 05:03.130
Give me a ruler! I'll measure it.

05:04.610 --> 05:06.320
Come on! Let's have a look!

05:11.300 --> 05:12.750
Sure! Put it here!

05:12.770 --> 05:14.440
I'll have it later.

05:14.540 --> 05:17.130
Watch out for me!

05:17.460 --> 05:18.740
Has Fan Xian had anything?

05:18.740 --> 05:20.290
Send some food to him after a while.

05:25.330 --> 05:27.070
Mine is ready.

05:27.090 --> 05:28.810
Are you all ready?

05:28.890 --> 05:31.040
So, here comes the first pair.

05:34.050 --> 05:35.700
Once they are put down, it's fixed. No regret!

05:35.700 --> 05:37.570
No change once you put it down.

05:38.370 --> 05:39.720
I'll turn mine first.

05:41.210 --> 05:42.570
Nine!

05:43.460 --> 05:44.610
Not as big as mine!

05:44.610 --> 05:45.880
That's too small!

05:51.170 --> 05:51.740
Excuse me!

05:51.740 --> 05:53.250
Excuse me! Excuse me!

05:54.090 --> 05:55.310
Needless to see!

05:55.330 --> 05:58.470
D three plus two four. That's Gee Joon.

05:58.490 --> 06:00.440
Nothing can be bigger than this.

06:00.460 --> 06:01.280
Let's see.

06:01.300 --> 06:02.440
Mom, one tael please.

06:02.460 --> 06:03.810
And one tael from sister.

06:03.980 --> 06:04.770
Dad, you should

06:04.770 --> 06:05.540
pay me for what you owed

06:05.540 --> 06:06.400
from last game.

06:06.420 --> 06:08.750
That's two taels five qians and eight fens.
(Qian and fen are currency units in ancient China.)

06:08.770 --> 06:09.970
Right?

06:10.050 --> 06:11.640
Don't kick me!

06:13.020 --> 06:14.170
It's not necessary to calculate so clearly

06:14.170 --> 06:15.260
within the family.

06:15.260 --> 06:16.370
No, that's not right.

06:16.370 --> 06:18.460
It needs to be super clear among family members.

06:18.460 --> 06:19.580
Why would we play it if not for money?!

06:19.580 --> 06:20.560
Don't you think so?

06:20.580 --> 06:21.440
Come on!

06:21.460 --> 06:22.560
let's not stop this

06:22.580 --> 06:24.160
if we don't use up the money today, alright?

06:24.490 --> 06:26.010
Let's keep playing then.

06:28.610 --> 06:31.310
This is more like a family.

06:31.330 --> 06:32.590
Stop cottoning up.

06:32.610 --> 06:34.260
Financial matters should be settled
clearly though we are a family,

06:34.260 --> 06:34.930
right?

06:34.930 --> 06:37.090
One tael! One tael!

06:37.330 --> 06:39.290
Two taels five qians and eight fens.

06:48.980 --> 06:50.690
Thank you, dad!

06:58.420 --> 06:59.280
It's done!

06:59.300 --> 07:00.280
What are you doing?

07:00.300 --> 07:01.020
You said there is a place

07:01.020 --> 07:02.410
to find out some clues.

07:03.770 --> 07:05.130
Wait for me.

07:07.330 --> 07:09.010
How mysterious!

07:10.370 --> 07:11.310
Here comes the Teens!

07:11.330 --> 07:13.160
Money! Money! Money!

07:13.650 --> 07:14.440
Come on, sister!

07:14.460 --> 07:15.720
I don't have any money left.

07:15.740 --> 07:17.560
That's not a problem.

07:17.580 --> 07:18.750
I have a lot.

07:18.770 --> 07:19.590
You are my biological elder sister,

07:19.610 --> 07:21.170
you can borrow it from me

07:21.170 --> 07:22.490
if only you pay me the interest.

07:22.490 --> 07:23.600
What do you think?

07:24.860 --> 07:26.200
It's getting dark.

07:30.770 --> 07:33.600
Let's call it a day!

07:46.460 --> 07:47.640
Mom,

07:48.610 --> 07:49.820
did I win all the money

07:49.820 --> 07:51.320
from dad just now?

07:51.770 --> 07:53.530
Evidently!

07:56.140 --> 07:58.090
Why didn't he scold me?

07:58.740 --> 08:00.130
Excuse me! I've gotta go now!

08:06.820 --> 08:09.070
What do you think of Fan Xian?

08:09.090 --> 08:10.690
Not bad. He's a good guy!

08:10.820 --> 08:12.470
He can fight and also write books.

08:12.490 --> 08:13.980
The books he wrote are great!

08:13.980 --> 08:15.150
They sell very well.

08:15.170 --> 08:15.960
We even want to

08:15.980 --> 08:17.760
open up book stores together.

08:19.460 --> 08:20.720
That's not bad!

08:21.210 --> 08:23.200
He can teach you a lot.

08:23.930 --> 08:25.310
What's the matter, mom?

08:25.330 --> 08:25.820
You have hated him

08:25.820 --> 08:27.290
for a long time.

08:27.540 --> 08:29.400
Now it seems we'd better

08:29.420 --> 08:30.960
not be enemies of him.

08:30.980 --> 08:32.290
You're right!

08:32.900 --> 08:34.400
May I?

08:38.040 --> 08:42.070
=Fan Mansion=

08:46.530 --> 08:47.920
Ruoruo!

08:48.140 --> 08:50.370
Brother, what are you doing?

08:50.490 --> 08:52.270
It's pretty dry in the capital city.

08:52.290 --> 08:54.030
I'm making a humidifier.

08:54.050 --> 08:55.650
Humidifier?

08:55.700 --> 08:57.050
It can humidify the air

08:57.050 --> 08:58.600
in the room.

08:58.850 --> 09:00.140
Can't you just put a barrel of water?

09:00.140 --> 09:00.880
You won't understand

09:00.900 --> 09:02.590
before I make it ready.

09:02.610 --> 09:03.470
We should

09:03.490 --> 09:05.810
make our life more exquisite.

09:09.930 --> 09:11.160
By the way,

09:11.460 --> 09:13.130
how was the Pai Gow?

09:14.290 --> 09:16.650
Fan Sizhe won it all.

09:17.730 --> 09:18.910
Are you here to borrow money?

09:18.930 --> 09:20.150
No!

09:20.170 --> 09:22.030
I'm here to tell you that

09:22.050 --> 09:23.760
dad did not say any harsh words

09:23.780 --> 09:24.580
to Fan Sizhe

09:24.580 --> 09:26.120
while we were playing Pai Gow.

09:26.140 --> 09:29.880
We were quite like a family.

09:29.900 --> 09:31.240
That's so sweet.

09:31.260 --> 09:33.080
Thanks to you!

09:33.100 --> 09:33.900
Your presence seems

09:33.900 --> 09:35.920
to change everything.

09:43.410 --> 09:45.570
I can change nothing.

09:46.820 --> 09:50.330
I don't have the capability, nor the willingness.

09:50.490 --> 09:53.040
What happened, brother?

09:53.700 --> 09:55.080
Nothing!

09:55.100 --> 09:57.280
I went to the Investigator's Office today

09:57.490 --> 09:59.350
and saw the words

09:59.370 --> 10:01.000
left on the stele by my mom.

10:01.020 --> 10:02.440
What does it say?

10:02.460 --> 10:04.560
She wanted to change the rules

10:04.580 --> 10:06.400
and reshape the world!

10:06.700 --> 10:08.840
Reshape the world!

10:09.220 --> 10:11.160
That sounds remarkable!

10:11.220 --> 10:12.820
It's an implication to work against the world

10:12.820 --> 10:14.330
with one's individual power.

10:14.580 --> 10:17.400
It is indeed remarkable.

10:27.930 --> 10:30.250
However, I'm not that type of person.

10:30.930 --> 10:32.390
I just want to lead a regular life

10:32.410 --> 10:34.040
and die in due course.

10:34.370 --> 10:36.400
That's also good.

10:37.780 --> 10:39.240
But I think

10:39.260 --> 10:40.020
I'd live much more happily

10:40.020 --> 10:42.250
if we really turn the world

10:42.850 --> 10:44.470
into what is described on the stele.

10:44.490 --> 10:45.140
Then turn it

10:45.140 --> 10:46.720
into that.

10:47.930 --> 10:49.270
The world would collapse

10:49.290 --> 10:50.890
and turn into turmoil.

10:52.100 --> 10:53.030
Whatever it is

10:53.050 --> 10:54.650
as long as you like.

10:54.930 --> 10:56.510
You have no principles, do you?

10:56.530 --> 10:57.640
I believe you, brother.

10:57.660 --> 10:59.400
Believing in you is my principle.

11:02.610 --> 11:03.440
It's fine!

11:03.460 --> 11:05.250
Nothing to hide from Ruoruo!

11:07.140 --> 11:08.720
It's your call anyway!

11:10.050 --> 11:10.850
What's this?

11:10.850 --> 11:12.760
Nocturnal costume tailor-made according to your size.

11:12.780 --> 11:13.640
What should I do with it?

11:13.660 --> 11:14.830
Don't you want to find out clues?

11:14.850 --> 11:16.150
Get changed and follow me!

11:16.170 --> 11:17.560
Where are you going and for what?

11:17.580 --> 11:18.290
Can I come along?

11:18.290 --> 11:19.520
No!

11:41.020 --> 11:42.350
What are you doing?

11:42.370 --> 11:43.900
Brother, I've been dreaming to

11:43.900 --> 11:44.780
start a night adventure

11:44.780 --> 11:46.490
like this in tales.

11:46.490 --> 11:48.330
I really made it.

11:54.490 --> 11:55.950
Let me repeat it.

11:55.970 --> 11:57.220
Only Fan Xian will be allowed

11:57.220 --> 11:58.480
to get in.

11:58.970 --> 11:59.830
Why?

11:59.850 --> 12:00.290
Because only the person

12:00.290 --> 12:01.460
who dressed up in this costume

12:01.460 --> 12:02.470
can get in there.

12:02.490 --> 12:03.320
What do you mean by get in?

12:03.340 --> 12:05.470
There is a shop over there.

12:05.490 --> 12:06.410
It sells nothing

12:06.410 --> 12:07.710
but intelligence.

12:07.730 --> 12:09.020
Regardless of the officialdom or the underworld,

12:09.020 --> 12:10.260
they would all go for their luck

12:10.260 --> 12:12.000
whenever they need any intelligence.

12:12.020 --> 12:12.880
And certainly,

12:12.900 --> 12:13.970
not everyone can get in there.

12:13.970 --> 12:15.660
It needs connection and a lot of silvers.

12:15.660 --> 12:16.920
Most importantly,

12:16.970 --> 12:17.660
it's essential

12:17.660 --> 12:19.330
to put on this nocturnal costume.

12:21.970 --> 12:23.170
Whose costume is it?

12:23.170 --> 12:24.330
Mine!

12:25.850 --> 12:27.130
Fan Xian,

12:27.490 --> 12:29.120
don't put up very high expectation on it.

12:29.140 --> 12:30.120
Otherwise,

12:30.140 --> 12:31.850
I would not have asked you to go to the Investigator's Office

12:31.850 --> 12:32.910
to get that file for me.

12:32.930 --> 12:34.160
What file?

12:35.780 --> 12:36.490
From now on,

12:36.490 --> 12:38.120
all three of us are normal people.

12:38.140 --> 12:40.160
Don't act as if you had conversion disorder.

12:40.340 --> 12:41.600
Let's go!

12:43.020 --> 12:44.520
What file do you mean?

12:52.970 --> 12:53.610
Is this it?

12:53.610 --> 12:54.710
Yeah!

12:54.730 --> 12:55.710
Zijing,

12:55.730 --> 12:57.610
you described it mysterious,

12:57.610 --> 12:59.030
but its facade is not at all hidden.

12:59.050 --> 12:59.700
It's run by swindler

12:59.700 --> 13:01.130
at first sight.

13:01.820 --> 13:03.160
We can go back now.

13:03.530 --> 13:04.880
Now that we are here,

13:04.900 --> 13:06.520
let me take a look inside.

13:09.100 --> 13:10.960
I told you he is the only person to be allowed.

13:18.780 --> 13:21.330
Once bet, no regret!

13:31.410 --> 13:32.810
What do we do next?

13:32.970 --> 13:33.910
Wait!

13:33.930 --> 13:34.830
Aren't we going?

13:34.850 --> 13:36.770
It's better if we can observe on the roof.

13:37.020 --> 13:38.150
Then let's go to the roof.

13:38.170 --> 13:39.520
Are you able to?

13:41.730 --> 13:42.510
No!

13:42.530 --> 13:43.810
Then let's wait.

13:47.530 --> 13:48.580
Come on! Once bet, no regret!

13:48.580 --> 13:49.590
Once bet, no regret!

13:49.610 --> 13:52.040
Big or small! Hurry up!

13:52.170 --> 13:53.470
Here we go!

13:53.490 --> 13:54.930
I need the connection details of Xu Yunzhang

13:54.930 --> 13:56.890
from the Fourth Division of the Investigator's Office.

13:57.050 --> 13:58.200
One moment.

13:58.220 --> 13:59.640
Come on! Once again!

13:59.660 --> 14:00.930
Come on! Once again!

14:00.930 --> 14:02.520
Big or small?

14:09.260 --> 14:11.330
Once bet, no regret!

14:21.820 --> 14:23.960
There is bird in the sky so late.

14:24.140 --> 14:26.010
It could be an owl.

14:29.260 --> 14:30.520
Fine!

14:33.850 --> 14:34.950
Your Majesty!

14:34.970 --> 14:37.390
Fan Xian went to the shop that sells intelligence.

14:37.410 --> 14:39.610
He is inquiring about Xu Yunzhang.

14:39.610 --> 14:41.520
Give it to him then.

14:42.220 --> 14:43.480
Your Majesty!

14:48.290 --> 14:50.730
Come on! Once bet, no regret!

14:50.730 --> 14:52.370
Once bet, no regret!

14:52.370 --> 14:53.820
Bet on small! Big! Big! Big!

14:53.820 --> 14:54.820
There is both big and small.

14:54.820 --> 14:57.100
Once bet, no regret! Once bet, no regret!

14:57.100 --> 14:59.150
=Give it to Fan Xian.=

14:59.170 --> 15:01.480
Three, five, four. Big!

15:02.530 --> 15:04.290
What luck it is!

15:04.290 --> 15:05.520
Sir,

15:08.610 --> 15:09.680
here you are!

15:09.700 --> 15:11.370
So you really have it.

15:47.660 --> 15:48.730
Xu Yunzhang has connection

15:48.730 --> 15:50.450
with the Eastern Palace.

15:51.050 --> 15:53.010
That means the Crown Prince wanted to kill you.

15:54.490 --> 15:55.770
This is not right!

16:17.820 --> 16:19.000
All gone!

16:19.020 --> 16:20.000
Not a single people left.

16:20.020 --> 16:21.250
Do you think

16:21.370 --> 16:23.010
it's fake intelligence?

16:25.100 --> 16:26.700
It has a lot of details

16:26.700 --> 16:27.710
with collateral evidence.

16:27.730 --> 16:28.800
It can't be faked.

16:28.820 --> 16:30.370
Why did you turn back?

16:31.530 --> 16:33.400
Wang Qinian told me

16:34.050 --> 16:35.340
the Head of the Investigator's Office

16:35.340 --> 16:37.720
handled Xu Yunzhang's case in person.

16:38.370 --> 16:39.320
So reasonably,

16:39.340 --> 16:40.340
the intelligence about it

16:40.340 --> 16:42.010
is super confidential.

16:42.460 --> 16:43.410
But we got it

16:43.410 --> 16:44.710
so easily.

16:44.730 --> 16:46.650
Don't you think it's too smooth?

16:47.020 --> 16:47.880
Besides,

16:47.900 --> 16:48.850
my teacher told me

16:48.850 --> 16:50.320
the Investigator's Office has enormous power.

16:50.340 --> 16:51.680
That's true.

16:51.700 --> 16:53.140
It can watch over all officials.

16:53.140 --> 16:54.840
Everyone is afraid of it.

16:55.220 --> 16:56.680
In view of this background,

16:56.700 --> 16:57.660
why does this intelligence shop even exist

16:57.660 --> 16:59.290
in the capital city?

16:59.290 --> 17:00.960
Doesn't the Investigator's Office know about it?

17:01.580 --> 17:02.530
It ought to know it.

17:02.530 --> 17:03.960
Then why hasn't it been closed down?

17:03.980 --> 17:05.530
I haven't thought about that.

17:05.860 --> 17:07.220
Could this shop

17:07.220 --> 17:09.320
be run by the Investigator's Office?

17:09.340 --> 17:10.840
Another possibility is that

17:11.770 --> 17:13.910
the owner of this shop is too powerful

17:13.930 --> 17:15.410
for the Investigator's Office to govern.

17:15.410 --> 17:16.510
Not likely.

17:16.530 --> 17:17.700
You probably don't know

17:17.700 --> 17:18.460
how powerful

17:18.460 --> 17:19.440
the Investigator's Office is.

17:19.460 --> 17:21.200
Ever since I came to the capital city,

17:21.220 --> 17:22.960
the follower of the Crown Prince provoked troubles,

17:22.980 --> 17:25.510
Prince Jing's son invited me to the poetry gathering,

17:25.530 --> 17:27.600
and the truth of the assassination becomes abundantly clear.

17:27.620 --> 17:29.080
All these matters came one after another

17:29.100 --> 17:30.650
as if they were all controlled

17:30.650 --> 17:32.370
by a large hand from the behind

17:32.580 --> 17:34.680
which put me in the teeth of the storm.

17:36.580 --> 17:37.960
Your Majesty,

17:38.100 --> 17:39.910
Fan Xian returned.

17:39.930 --> 17:41.840
I'm afraid he is suspicious now.

17:41.980 --> 17:44.370
That doesn't matter.

17:44.460 --> 17:46.870
It's a great pity for the shop.

17:46.890 --> 17:47.750
The shop?

17:47.770 --> 17:49.110
That's a shelter

17:49.130 --> 17:50.500
to the outlaws

17:50.500 --> 17:51.630
given by Chen Pingping.

17:51.650 --> 17:53.200
We can build another one.

17:53.220 --> 17:54.580
We let Fan Xian know

17:54.580 --> 17:56.320
the connection between Xu Yunzhang

17:56.340 --> 17:57.990
and the Eastern Palace in such a simple way.

17:58.010 --> 18:00.200
Isn't that a bit too direct?

18:00.700 --> 18:02.960
The identity changes so drastically.

18:02.980 --> 18:06.530
I guess Fan Xian will be deadly scared.

18:06.770 --> 18:07.930
If that's the case,

18:07.930 --> 18:08.650
he can't take up the position

18:08.650 --> 18:10.680
to manage Neiku.

18:10.700 --> 18:11.500
The harsh suffering

18:11.500 --> 18:13.650
is a test to him.

18:26.820 --> 18:28.110
Who do you think will win?

18:28.130 --> 18:29.250
This is a large assembly of talents.

18:29.250 --> 18:29.930
Very hard to tell!

18:29.930 --> 18:31.320
That's right!

18:34.460 --> 18:36.080
-Where is he? -Wait!

18:36.500 --> 18:37.740
What a surprise! So many people!

18:37.740 --> 18:39.930
Of course. The Prince's son is the organizer.

18:54.930 --> 18:57.370
Where is His Highness?

18:59.130 --> 19:00.910
Please wait patiently, Mr. Guo.

19:00.930 --> 19:02.650
His Highness should arrive in no time.

19:16.960 --> 19:18.990
=Li Hongcheng, son of Prince Jing of Nanqing=

19:37.220 --> 19:38.650
Your Highness!

19:39.220 --> 19:40.480
Ruoruo!

19:40.980 --> 19:43.370
Isn't your brother coming?

19:45.410 --> 19:46.440
He...

19:46.460 --> 19:48.100
He said

19:48.100 --> 19:49.560
he needed to get changed half way.

19:51.980 --> 19:52.980
He prepared these particularly for you.

19:52.980 --> 19:55.370
Excuse me please!

19:57.770 --> 19:58.910
I'm late.

19:58.930 --> 20:00.770
Got the idea to get changed half way.

20:00.770 --> 20:01.650
As it's my first time to visit,

20:01.650 --> 20:03.200
I prepared a few gifts for you.

20:03.220 --> 20:05.230
This is glazed fruit.

20:05.250 --> 20:07.170
This is cane sugar.

20:08.250 --> 20:09.200
This...

20:09.220 --> 20:09.980
is some sort of seasoning which I don't know.

20:09.980 --> 20:11.250
You gotta try it yourself.

20:11.650 --> 20:12.250
And I bought two bags of persimmons for you

20:12.250 --> 20:13.510
on my way here.

20:13.530 --> 20:14.980
You are the Prince's son. And this is persimmon.
(Prince's son and persimmon have the same pronunciation in Chinese)

20:14.980 --> 20:16.250
It's some sort of luck.

20:18.460 --> 20:19.600
Is everybody here?

20:19.740 --> 20:20.530
Yes.

20:20.530 --> 20:21.560
You're the only one left.

20:21.580 --> 20:22.770
How about the ladies?

20:23.650 --> 20:26.050
Hurry up then. Let's get in.

20:31.560 --> 20:36.110
=Prince Jing's mansion.=

20:40.700 --> 20:42.410
Persimmon?

20:50.460 --> 20:52.460
Brother, so this is the dress

20:52.460 --> 20:53.800
you changed into?

20:53.820 --> 20:55.360
It's so Danzhou!

20:55.380 --> 20:57.960
What's wrong with Danzhou? Do you think I'm uncool?

20:57.980 --> 20:58.620
I wore this

20:58.620 --> 20:59.650
on the day

20:59.650 --> 21:00.870
I met Lady Drumstick.

21:00.890 --> 21:02.890
I'm afraid she is unable to recognize me if I change this.

21:07.220 --> 21:08.270
Brother,

21:08.290 --> 21:09.440
all the ladies are on that side

21:09.460 --> 21:11.200
for today.

21:11.220 --> 21:12.630
I'll need to join them as well.

21:12.650 --> 21:13.960
How about me?

21:19.290 --> 21:21.960
Who can stand out from the poetry gathering this time?

21:21.980 --> 21:24.130
Who knows!

21:24.130 --> 21:25.820
A lot of scholars want to make a great coup with it.

21:25.820 --> 21:26.890
They are all here today.

21:26.890 --> 21:29.100
It's the first time to have such a grand scene.

21:29.100 --> 21:30.250
It's such a great honor

21:30.250 --> 21:32.440
to be part of a poetry gathering like this.

21:32.460 --> 21:34.170
What a bliss!

21:54.770 --> 21:56.030
You really came here.

21:56.050 --> 21:57.480
Aren't you afraid to lose face?

21:57.500 --> 21:59.080
Now that you have come, shall we...

22:02.860 --> 22:03.700
Do you think you can hide

22:03.700 --> 22:05.170
by turning a deaf ear?

22:07.130 --> 22:08.680
What a jerk!

22:14.930 --> 22:15.620
What a scene!

22:15.620 --> 22:17.370
A man breaks in.

22:21.340 --> 22:22.600
How impolite he is!

22:22.620 --> 22:24.170
He is so rude!

22:31.650 --> 22:33.170
She is not there!

22:41.250 --> 22:43.680
Men live in this world based on rites.

22:43.700 --> 22:45.270
A gentleman can have no fancy clothes

22:45.290 --> 22:46.560
but cannot do without rites.

22:46.580 --> 22:47.770
Who are you?

22:48.580 --> 22:49.910
I'm He Zongwei.

22:49.930 --> 22:51.030
We've met yesterday

22:51.050 --> 22:52.410
at Yishi House.

22:53.050 --> 22:54.960
Are all the ladies here?

22:55.930 --> 22:57.600
Is there anyone else coming?

22:57.620 --> 22:58.930
Fan Xian,

22:59.170 --> 23:00.960
why are you so rude?

23:01.530 --> 23:04.050
Calm down, gentlemen!

23:06.410 --> 23:08.080
Since this is a poetry gathering,

23:08.100 --> 23:10.320
we'd better make friends by composing poems.

23:11.500 --> 23:12.510
Your Highness,

23:12.530 --> 23:13.500
do you know a lady

23:13.500 --> 23:15.440
who likes to hold a drumstick?

23:15.460 --> 23:16.630
What...

23:16.650 --> 23:17.560
is it again?

23:17.580 --> 23:19.290
Drumstick!

23:19.530 --> 23:21.050
Namely, the leg of chicken.

23:24.170 --> 23:25.840
We will prepare that during lunch.

23:26.050 --> 23:27.890
Take your seats please.

23:38.700 --> 23:40.600
Your Highness is right.

23:40.620 --> 23:42.620
As this is a competition among scholars,

23:42.620 --> 23:45.200
of course, we should do it by composing poems.

23:45.460 --> 23:46.650
What's the point to compete with that?

23:46.650 --> 23:47.890
You will lose for sure!

23:47.890 --> 23:50.080
How arrogant you are!

23:51.860 --> 23:52.910
Fan Xian,

23:52.930 --> 23:54.960
if you don't dare to compete with me,

23:54.980 --> 23:56.270
just kneel in front of me as an apology.

23:56.290 --> 23:58.250
You will be forgiven.

23:58.290 --> 23:59.410
As I said,

23:59.410 --> 24:00.840
you will lose for sure.

24:00.860 --> 24:01.820
That's ridiculous!

24:01.820 --> 24:03.560
Who do you think you are?

24:03.580 --> 24:04.930
A great master of poem?

24:04.930 --> 24:06.960
Alright! Tell me how do we do it.

24:21.170 --> 24:22.480
One!

24:22.620 --> 24:24.030
Two!

24:24.050 --> 24:25.080
Three!

24:25.100 --> 24:25.990
Four!

24:26.010 --> 24:27.200
Five!

24:27.220 --> 24:28.110
Six!

24:28.130 --> 24:28.990
Seven!

24:29.010 --> 24:30.150
Eight!

24:30.170 --> 24:31.080
Nine!

24:31.100 --> 24:32.480
Ten!

24:33.460 --> 24:34.720
Your Highness,

24:35.740 --> 24:38.030
take ten steps till here.

24:38.050 --> 24:39.560
The poem must be completed

24:39.580 --> 24:41.220
and read out loud

24:41.220 --> 24:43.720
so that everyone present can evaluate who wins.

24:44.170 --> 24:45.110
Do you agree?

24:45.130 --> 24:46.410
Fantastic!

25:26.460 --> 25:29.410
Red Mansions is indeed awesome.

25:29.460 --> 25:31.080
It's a sufficient lifetime comfort

25:31.130 --> 25:33.480
to read such a marvelous book.

25:35.770 --> 25:37.170
Report it here!

25:39.740 --> 25:41.530
His Highness asked me to report.

25:41.530 --> 25:42.620
For the poem contest,

25:42.620 --> 25:44.580
Guo Baokun proposed to compose a poem within ten steps.

25:44.580 --> 25:45.220
Before the dusk comes,

25:45.220 --> 25:47.050
all poems will be considered together.

25:47.050 --> 25:48.560
Did Fan Xian agree with it?

25:48.580 --> 25:49.600
Fan Xian refused it.

25:49.620 --> 25:50.930
He said no matter how many poems

25:50.930 --> 25:52.510
Guo Baokun and He Zongwei compose,

25:52.530 --> 25:55.130
he will win it with just one.

25:55.580 --> 25:57.320
That's very arrogant!

25:58.820 --> 26:00.250
Good!

26:01.770 --> 26:04.410
One poem is enough to win it?!

26:05.890 --> 26:07.030
Mr. Fan,

26:07.050 --> 26:09.500
do you think Mr. Guo and I

26:09.500 --> 26:11.510
are so untenable?

26:11.530 --> 26:13.080
Countryside man like you

26:13.100 --> 26:15.930
can probably only compose one poem.

26:16.410 --> 26:17.960
After you!

26:42.250 --> 26:44.220
I feel a strong urge to write poetry

26:44.220 --> 26:45.720
and express my feelings at the moment.

26:45.740 --> 26:47.170
Please excuse me.

27:23.170 --> 27:27.530
At the tower, I stand in the mist;

27:27.930 --> 27:32.840
A boat on the river forms a picturesque view.

27:33.340 --> 27:37.960
A wide expanse of mist-covered waters shields the sky;

27:38.100 --> 27:42.960
A scholar writes articles in the dim light.

27:42.980 --> 27:43.650
Well done!

27:43.650 --> 27:45.800
That's really a good poem.

27:47.770 --> 27:51.110
Good point with the last line.

27:51.130 --> 27:52.750
Quite a good poem that is!

27:52.770 --> 27:54.370
The falling tone and rising tone don't match.

27:55.650 --> 27:57.110
Let's keep that aside first.

27:57.130 --> 27:59.440
The poem is full of fancy words

27:59.460 --> 28:00.930
which shows no sign of thinking.

28:04.620 --> 28:06.480
You...

28:06.500 --> 28:07.800
Mr. Guo!

28:08.770 --> 28:10.170
Mr. Fan,

28:10.340 --> 28:11.750
It may have some flaws,

28:11.770 --> 28:14.840
but composing a poem in such
a short while is already not easy.

28:14.860 --> 28:18.080
Since you want to see some sign of thinking,

28:18.100 --> 28:20.800
at the time when I left home

28:20.820 --> 28:21.870
for the capital city

28:21.890 --> 28:23.340
with a whole lot of dreams,

28:23.340 --> 28:24.870
I also composed a poem.

28:24.890 --> 28:26.320
Simple and crude it might be,

28:26.650 --> 28:29.930
it has the thoughts from inside my heart.

28:30.700 --> 28:33.050
Just read it out if you want!

28:34.290 --> 28:35.600
Your Highness,

28:35.650 --> 28:37.680
-May I? -Please!

28:38.410 --> 28:39.720
Excuse me!

28:47.650 --> 28:51.170
I look towards the east skyline, far and remote;

28:51.250 --> 28:54.510
I start up a journey in white, on a frosted road.

28:54.530 --> 28:56.870
Don't say I'd travel alone.

28:56.890 --> 29:00.630
The green hills will see me off in the glow.

29:00.650 --> 29:06.080
Good! Good! Good!

29:09.980 --> 29:10.960
There was a bit of arrogance

29:10.980 --> 29:12.510
when it was composed.

29:12.530 --> 29:14.380
Did you ever predict

29:14.380 --> 29:16.230
you would end up as a follower

29:16.250 --> 29:18.200
licking others' boots?

29:18.530 --> 29:20.680
That's really mean.

29:20.700 --> 29:21.530
Are you able

29:21.530 --> 29:23.530
to compose any really good poems?

29:25.650 --> 29:27.200
Here it goes!

29:29.500 --> 29:31.200
That's unbelievable!

29:31.650 --> 29:33.370
Look! It's his turn now.

29:33.650 --> 29:35.080
Mr. Fan,

29:35.100 --> 29:36.720
one poem in ten steps.

29:36.740 --> 29:38.440
Don't you need to reconsider it?

29:38.580 --> 29:39.860
I didn't find the person I wanted to see.

29:39.860 --> 29:40.750
So I'm not in a good mood.

29:40.770 --> 29:42.200
I'll just write it directly.

29:44.860 --> 29:47.650
Gentlemen, let's make a bet.

29:47.700 --> 29:50.530
After I write down my poem,

29:50.530 --> 29:53.050
I'll stop composing poem for my whole life

29:53.820 --> 29:55.600
if you can come up with better ones.

29:56.130 --> 29:57.800
If I lose,

29:57.980 --> 30:00.440
I'll never compose poems any more.

30:06.530 --> 30:08.650
It's not poems that you're composing.

30:09.620 --> 30:11.410
It's trouble.

30:37.100 --> 30:42.960
The wind so swift, the sky so wide, apes wail and cry;

30:44.130 --> 30:49.480
Water so clear and beach so white, birds wheel and fly.

30:56.820 --> 31:00.410
The boundless forest sheds its leaves shower by shower;

31:04.770 --> 31:08.370
The endless river rolls its waves hour after hour.

31:08.500 --> 31:10.010
Good poem!

31:11.580 --> 31:15.130
A thousand miles from home, I'm grieved at autumn's plight;

31:15.380 --> 31:18.480
I'll now and then for years, alone I'm on this height.

31:19.380 --> 31:23.320
Living in times so hard, at frosted hair I pine;

31:24.010 --> 31:26.840
Cast down by poverty,

31:27.170 --> 31:30.050
I have to give up wine.

31:42.010 --> 31:46.370
A thousand miles, autumn's plight, years of illness...

31:47.380 --> 31:50.770
A few lines of words depict the
millennium sorrow so thoroughly.

31:51.650 --> 31:54.370
This poem from today's poetry gathering

31:55.100 --> 31:57.200
will be remembered by history.

32:07.500 --> 32:08.800
I'm done!

32:09.530 --> 32:10.930
It's your turn.

32:11.170 --> 32:12.370
Take your time.

32:12.530 --> 32:14.320
Make it as long as it needs to be.

32:14.340 --> 32:15.800
As long as it can be better than this one,

32:15.820 --> 32:17.250
you win.

32:19.130 --> 32:21.840
That's Du Fu's work.

32:21.860 --> 32:22.860
The poem named On the Height

32:22.860 --> 32:24.910
is considered to be the best Lüshi.

32:24.930 --> 32:27.250
Don't you ever try to compose poems for the rest of your life.

32:30.170 --> 32:31.650
Where is the toilet?

32:31.890 --> 32:33.170
In the backyard.

32:33.530 --> 32:34.630
Which way?

32:34.650 --> 32:36.200
This way!

32:37.890 --> 32:39.530
Take care of my sister.

32:45.740 --> 32:47.580
It's amazing!

32:47.580 --> 32:49.930
Just awesome!

32:52.740 --> 32:53.500
Forgive me, Saint of Poem!

32:53.500 --> 32:55.250
I'm sorry.

32:55.410 --> 32:56.630
But they are really too arrogant.

32:56.650 --> 32:58.220
I have to teach them a lesson with your poem.

32:58.220 --> 32:59.650
Mr. Fan!

33:01.620 --> 33:05.050
You're indeed outstanding in literature.

33:05.250 --> 33:07.630
But scholars need mental cultivation.

33:07.650 --> 33:08.820
You don't have to

33:08.820 --> 33:10.480
look down on scholars in the world.

33:10.500 --> 33:13.050
If you can calm down and focus on self-cultivation,

33:13.050 --> 33:14.700
you're bound to become

33:14.700 --> 33:16.170
a master of words.

33:16.620 --> 33:18.600
Guo Baokun is shameless.

33:18.820 --> 33:20.370
You're even worse.

33:21.530 --> 33:23.050
When Guo Baokun humiliates others,

33:23.050 --> 33:24.390
you repeat with him aside.

33:24.410 --> 33:26.050
When he aggressively proposed for a poem contest,

33:26.050 --> 33:27.510
why didn't you ask him for self-cultivation?!

33:27.530 --> 33:28.620
As you have lost the contest,

33:28.620 --> 33:29.440
you require me to maintain self-cultivation

33:29.460 --> 33:30.960
and make concession.

33:31.340 --> 33:33.130
Scholar He,

33:33.860 --> 33:35.530
don't you feel ashamed?

34:07.170 --> 34:08.180
Let him in.

34:08.200 --> 34:09.390
=Xie Bi'an, the bodyguard of the Second Prince.=

34:14.690 --> 34:16.030
Why would I get in?

34:16.050 --> 34:17.690
Then go back!

34:39.040 --> 34:40.840
=The Second Prince of Nanqing, Li Chengze.=

34:40.860 --> 34:42.560
Fan Xian!

34:42.940 --> 34:44.280
You know me?

34:44.450 --> 34:45.970
The Crown Prince takes you as enemy.

34:45.970 --> 34:47.880
Of course, I need to remember your name.

34:47.900 --> 34:49.170
What are you?

35:02.730 --> 35:04.210
You have three chances to make a guess.

35:07.050 --> 35:08.450
The Second Prince!

35:08.860 --> 35:10.190
Smart!

35:10.210 --> 35:11.600
Is there anything I can help you?

35:11.620 --> 35:14.340
The Crown Prince and I got estranged

35:14.340 --> 35:17.040
and you're a person he doesn't like.

35:18.730 --> 35:20.930
You want to draw me over to your side?

35:23.180 --> 35:24.930
I will kill you

35:25.290 --> 35:26.180
and present your body

35:26.180 --> 35:27.290
to him as a gift

35:27.290 --> 35:30.170
so that we can be reconciled like before.

35:37.420 --> 35:40.000
If so, you might need to consider

35:40.420 --> 35:42.490
if his sword is faster

35:43.210 --> 35:45.650
than my hand reaching out to you.

35:57.380 --> 35:58.970
Looks like the sword is faster.

36:06.490 --> 36:09.080
Anyone else who has poems?

36:20.210 --> 36:20.990
Your Highness!

36:21.010 --> 36:22.280
Please!

36:26.340 --> 36:28.750
The poem from Mr. Fan

36:28.770 --> 36:31.000
is indeed extraordinary.

36:31.820 --> 36:33.210
However...

36:35.690 --> 36:39.040
his hand-writing is a bit inferior.

36:39.210 --> 36:40.560
Is that right?

36:43.730 --> 36:45.080
Yeah, it's true.

36:45.100 --> 36:45.730
It's awfully written

36:45.730 --> 36:46.950
by its look.

36:46.970 --> 36:48.240
Awful!

36:50.490 --> 36:53.210
The contest is meant to about the poem not hand-writing.

36:53.420 --> 36:54.970
My brother has made his point clear.

36:55.100 --> 36:56.400
Just keep writing whatever you want.

36:56.420 --> 36:58.800
This is the only poem he will compete with.

37:03.210 --> 37:05.130
The writing is too ugly.

37:08.210 --> 37:11.520
So, you don't want to write?

37:19.940 --> 37:21.190
If you lose,

37:21.210 --> 37:23.040
you're forbidden to compose poem for the rest of your life.

37:23.210 --> 37:25.270
As a scholar graduated from famous school

37:25.290 --> 37:27.320
and the Imperial Compiler in palace,

37:27.340 --> 37:30.210
you will keep your word, won't you?

37:32.900 --> 37:34.450
Of course.

37:35.180 --> 37:36.360
Do you need me

37:36.380 --> 37:38.370
to have the paper and brush delivered to you?

37:43.380 --> 37:44.160
Young Master,

37:44.180 --> 37:45.080
these are for you.

37:45.100 --> 37:47.130
Superior Langhao brush!

37:48.250 --> 37:49.010
Young Master!

37:49.010 --> 37:50.180
Piss off!

37:50.180 --> 37:50.820
What a follower!

37:50.820 --> 37:51.930
Young Master!

37:52.010 --> 37:53.210
-Piss off now! -Young Master!

37:53.210 --> 37:54.180
Whose side are you on?

37:54.180 --> 37:54.940
Don't you understand what she means?

37:54.940 --> 37:55.730
Why do you take her orders?

37:55.730 --> 37:56.820
-Young Master! -Go away!

37:56.820 --> 37:58.170
Get disappeared!

37:58.420 --> 37:59.970
You're obnoxious!

38:12.620 --> 38:13.760
So sweet!

38:13.860 --> 38:16.560
You'll be dead with a simple click of my tongue.

38:16.580 --> 38:18.450
Your Highness won't let that happen.

38:18.620 --> 38:20.750
Why not? As I said,

38:20.770 --> 38:22.670
I can reconcile with Crown Prince

38:22.690 --> 38:24.840
with your head.

38:24.860 --> 38:26.420
Your Highness and the Crown Prince can't reconcile

38:26.420 --> 38:27.640
with a thousand heads of Fan Xian.

38:27.660 --> 38:28.890
How dare you!

38:38.290 --> 38:39.760
Any other reasons?

38:42.490 --> 38:44.560
If Your Highness really want to kill me,

38:44.580 --> 38:45.890
this will not be the place,

38:47.730 --> 38:49.840
nor by this means.

38:50.100 --> 38:51.690
This is so unwise.

38:56.620 --> 38:58.210
Bi'an,

39:01.250 --> 39:02.840
retrieve your sword.

39:15.620 --> 39:18.750
Your poem is very good!

39:18.770 --> 39:20.760
I wanted to meet you as soon as I read it.

39:21.100 --> 39:22.880
I don't want to meet you.

39:22.900 --> 39:24.320
If I had known that you're here,

39:24.340 --> 39:26.130
I would not have walked this way.

39:26.770 --> 39:27.950
Why?

39:27.970 --> 39:29.490
The Crown Prince must think

39:29.490 --> 39:31.000
I have come under your service

39:31.340 --> 39:32.490
once he knows

39:32.490 --> 39:34.560
I have met Your Highness.

39:34.580 --> 39:36.130
My days to come

39:36.180 --> 39:37.760
will be difficult.

39:47.010 --> 39:49.930
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

39:50.100 --> 39:53.450
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

39:55.250 --> 39:56.320
Your Majesty!

39:56.340 --> 39:57.990
Mr. Fan has composed

39:58.010 --> 40:00.400
an unprecedentedly good poem.

40:00.420 --> 40:01.510
Read it!

40:01.530 --> 40:02.840
Yes!

40:04.690 --> 40:08.970
The wind so swift, the sky so wide, apes wail and cry;

40:09.770 --> 40:13.600
Water so clear and beach so white, birds wheel and fly.

40:13.620 --> 40:17.920
The boundless forest sheds its leaves shower by shower;

40:17.940 --> 40:21.600
The endless river rolls its waves hour after hour.

40:21.860 --> 40:25.190
A thousand miles from home, I'm grieved at autumn's plight;

40:25.210 --> 40:29.360
I'll now and then for years, alone I'm on this height.

40:29.380 --> 40:33.040
Living in times so hard, at frosted hair I pine;

40:33.290 --> 40:37.690
Cast down by poverty, I have to give up wine.

40:39.450 --> 40:42.600
It's just a bit too gloomy.

40:42.620 --> 40:44.940
After writing it down,

40:44.940 --> 40:47.880
Mr. Fan went to the backyard and met the Second Prince.

40:47.900 --> 40:50.900
I couldn't approach

40:50.900 --> 40:51.880
because the Second Prince has a swordsman with him.

40:51.900 --> 40:53.270
I was unable to hear

40:53.290 --> 40:55.170
what they talked about.

40:55.530 --> 40:56.670
Where is the Crown Prince?

40:56.690 --> 40:57.770
He is meeting Princess Royal

40:57.770 --> 41:00.320
at the Guangxin Palace.

41:01.100 --> 41:03.410
How attentive he is!

41:03.770 --> 41:05.770
Give the poem to him.

41:05.770 --> 41:07.040
Yes!

41:07.730 --> 41:08.660
Your Majesty,

41:08.660 --> 41:10.970
do you have anything else to deliver?

41:11.770 --> 41:14.190
Ask him to read the poem carefully

41:14.210 --> 41:16.970
and tell him the story

41:16.970 --> 41:18.180
happened at the Prince Jing's mansion.

41:18.180 --> 41:19.450
Yes!

41:24.900 --> 41:29.560
I'll now and then for years, alone I'm on this height.

41:35.140 --> 41:38.490
Living in times so hard, at frosted hair I pine;

41:39.180 --> 41:43.450
Cast down by poverty, I have to give up wine.

41:45.730 --> 41:47.930
Guo Baokun loses badly.

41:50.530 --> 41:52.030
His Majesty sends this.

41:52.050 --> 41:54.160
It's said to be composed by Fan Xian.

41:54.180 --> 41:55.800
He requires you to read it.

42:04.250 --> 42:05.490
Smart!

42:05.970 --> 42:07.970
You have not only the talent as a scholar

42:07.970 --> 42:10.030
but also the wisdom as a worldly person.

42:10.050 --> 42:11.280
That is rare.

42:23.730 --> 42:25.210
Thank you very much, Your Highness!

42:28.420 --> 42:30.030
The Crown Prince will know about

42:30.050 --> 42:31.930
us meeting each other sooner or later.

42:32.490 --> 42:33.950
Aren't you worried about that?

42:33.970 --> 42:34.970
Your Highness, do you know any girl

42:34.970 --> 42:36.600
who likes to eat drumsticks?

42:38.010 --> 42:40.320
Do you believe love at first sight?

42:44.140 --> 42:46.130
I didn't either,

42:46.860 --> 42:48.690
but I do now.

42:49.210 --> 42:50.750
I met a girl

42:50.770 --> 42:52.560
who had a drumstick in her hand.

42:52.730 --> 42:53.690
I want to share the story

42:53.690 --> 42:54.990
with you.

42:55.010 --> 42:56.240
Are you interested?

43:19.400 --> 43:22.980
In the river of history,

43:23.000 --> 43:26.470
time goes round and round.

43:29.280 --> 43:32.620
Memories about the former and present lives

43:32.640 --> 43:36.710
join each other in an endless way.

43:38.600 --> 43:41.220
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:41.240 --> 43:43.480
one season follows another in a flash,

43:43.480 --> 43:45.980
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:46.000 --> 43:47.600
I just can't give up

43:47.600 --> 43:50.940
to be with you for my whole life.

43:50.960 --> 43:56.430
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:57.680 --> 44:00.230
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:00.520 --> 44:02.560
Year after year in the wandering,

44:02.560 --> 44:05.220
I count the remaining years.

44:05.240 --> 44:07.420
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:07.440 --> 44:09.430
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:09.720 --> 44:12.110
I never feel regretful.

44:12.160 --> 44:13.520
In such a chaotic world,

44:13.520 --> 44:16.500
I still miss you as ever.

44:16.520 --> 44:19.470
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:19.760 --> 44:21.820
With a gentle heart,

44:21.840 --> 44:24.500
I cherish our remaining years.

44:24.520 --> 44:26.040
Even though we have to go through

44:26.040 --> 44:28.550
all the hardships along the journey,

44:28.680 --> 44:35.870
you always stay by my side,

44:35.960 --> 44:38.630
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:38.920 --> 44:41.000
Year after year in the wandering,

44:41.000 --> 44:43.660
I count the remaining years.

44:43.680 --> 44:45.820
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:45.840 --> 44:48.070
even though we end up the destiny,

44:48.280 --> 44:50.460
I never feel regretful.

44:50.480 --> 44:51.880
In such a chaotic world,

44:51.880 --> 44:54.940
I still miss you as ever.

44:54.960 --> 44:58.070
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:58.160 --> 45:00.300
With a gentle heart,

45:00.320 --> 45:03.020
I cherish our remaining years.

45:03.040 --> 45:04.480
Even though we have to go through

45:04.480 --> 45:07.140
all the hardships along the journey,

45:07.160 --> 45:15.920
you always stay by my side...
